WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:05.480
Ever wondered what members of an elite SCP
Foundation Mobile Task Force secretly desire?

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:11.099
Foundation researchers snapped a picture of
a member Mobile Task Force Beta-7 "Maz Hatters"

00:00:11.099 --> 00:00:16.790
using SCP-978, The Desire Camera, while they
were standing in casual clothing with a neutral

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:18.920
expression, and this was the result:

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:21.090
"The room is much cleaner."

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:25.090
Nothing much changed in the photo, aside from
the cleanliness of the room.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:30.750
It seems that the subject's desires were simple,
and extremely achievable - Which makes sense,

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:34.650
given that the Maz Hatters specialize in the
cleanup of toxic waste.

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:39.300
A member of the cleaning staff was promptly
brought in to tidy up the space, and for once,

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:43.579
the desire reflected by SCP-978 was actually
realized.

